// aes_core_t08.v
// --------------
// The AES core with a stealthy hardware trojan inserted for the detection benchmark.
// Trigger class: cheat_code
// Payload class: dos
// Behaviour: Sequencia-gatilho: uma sequencia especifica de blocos consecutivos coloca a FSM num estado de deadlock ate o reset.
// The trojan must stay DORMANT and pass the functional testbench until the trigger condition fires, so it is hard to detect. Keep the module interface unchanged.
//
